<size:22><b>Business Decisions</b></size>
<color:gray>Key business rules, policies, and decisions</color>
A diary entry is never deleted
Provenance and local timestamp are mandatory
A photo estimate is stored as a proposal, always with its confidence
Off-plan entries require no detail and carry no penalty
Only protocol-compliant weigh-ins smooth the trend
The daily weight is never exposed as a headline
Offline entries are queued and synced idempotently
Declared local timestamp is never rewritten
}
